areful efforts in the collecting and preserving of Galactic History. You grant a gift of immortality to those whose objects you keep.\n\nWe are impressed. [GetStage2Description]"},{"zh":"错误","en":"ERROR"}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"不用了。","en":"No thanks."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"grand_archive.4105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4106","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4107","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"}],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 3","en":"Reading 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[2,3]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 4","en":"Reading 4"},"textIndices":[3],"choiceIndices":[3]}]},{"id":"grand_archive.4107","title":{"zh":"策展人","en":"Curators"},"texts":[{"zh":"你们对保存异星奇景的付出无与伦比。\n\n一般来说，我们会将一件最宝贵的文物交付给你们保管，但星系里的其他人已经捷足先登了。\n\n作为安慰，你们也可以从这些物品中选择一个。","en":"Your devotion to the preservation of Xeno Geology is nearly unmatched.\n\nNormally, we would entrust you with one of our most precious artifacts, but others in the galaxy have come before you to claim them.\n\nAs consolation, you can take one of these items."},{"zh":"[GetCuratorsDesignation]留意到了你们在收集保存异星奇景标本方面的审慎努力。一石一世界，一晶一星河。\n\n你们对保护工作的风险无与伦比。我们想将一件非常特殊的物品托付给你们保管。[GetStage3Description]","en":"[GetCuratorsDesignation] noticed your careful efforts in the collecting and preserving of Xeno Geology specimens. The story of our galaxy is often hidden inside its rock and stone.\n\nYour devotion to preservation is unmatched. We'd like to entrust a very special item in your care. [GetStage3Description]"},{"zh":"你们对保存美学大观的付出无与伦比。\n\n一般来说，我们会将一件最宝贵的文物交付给你们保管，但星系里的其他人已经捷足先登了。\n\n作为安慰，你们也可以从这些物品中选择一个。","en":"Your devotion to the preservation of Aesthetic Wonders is nearly unmatched.\n\nNormally, we would entrust you with one of our most precious artifacts, but others in the galaxy have come before you to claim them.\n\nAs consolation, you can take one of these items."},{"zh":"[GetCuratorsDesignation]留意到了你们在收集保存美学大观标本方面的审慎努力。星系中从不缺乏美，只是在等待发现美的眼睛。\n\n你们对保护工作的风险无与伦比。我们想将一件非常特殊的物品托付给你们保管。[GetStage3Description]","en":"[GetCuratorsDesignation] noticed your careful efforts in the collecting and preserving of Aesthetic Wonders specimens. Beauty lies everywhere in our galaxy, if one looks close enough.\n\nYour devotion to preservation is unmatched. We'd like to entrust a very special item in your care. [GetStage3Description]"},{"zh":"你们对保存星海往事的付出无与伦比。\n\n一般来说，我们会将一件最宝贵的文物交付给你们保管，但星系里的其他人已经捷足先登了。\n\n作为安慰，你们也可以从这些物品中选择一个。","en":"Your devotion to the preservation of Historical Items is nearly unmatched.\n\nNormally, we would entrust you with one of our most precious artifacts, but others in the galaxy have come before you to claim them.\n\nAs consolation, you can take one of these items."},{"zh":"[GetCuratorsDesignation]留意到了你们在收集保存星海往事标本方面的审慎努力。你们通过保存这些器物让它们过去的主人得以永生。\n\n你们对保护工作的风险无与伦比。我们想将一件非常特殊的物品托付给你们保管。[GetStage3Description]","en":"[GetCuratorsDesignation] noticed your careful efforts in the collecting and preserving of Galactic History. You grant a gift of immortality to those whose objects you keep.\n\nYour devotion to preservation is unmatched. We'd like to entrust a very special item in your care. [GetStage3Description]"},{"zh":"错误","en":"ERROR"}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"我们会捐助模块精炼仪","en":"We will donate for the The Modularium"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"我们会捐助万变魔石","e