面知识的人分享我们星系的历史，这是一个值得赞扬的倡议。我们在这方面志同道合。\n\n我们希望能帮助你们实现这一目标。继续充实你的收藏，我们将会尽己所能提供帮助。","en":"We have received information that you have built a Grand Archive capable of supporting attendance on a massive scale. This is a commendable initiative in sharing our galaxy's history with all who seek such knowledge. We share common goals in this respect.\n\nWe are interested in helping you pursue this endeavor. Continue to expand your Collection, and we will in turn offer our support however we can."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"很好。","en":"Very well."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"grand_archive.4105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4106","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4107","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"}],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[0]}]},{"id":"grand_archive.500","title":{"zh":"","en":""},"texts":[],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":true,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"grand_archive.4105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4106","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4107","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"},{"target":"grand_archive.4121","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-3f7467ea2f12e627"}],"readings":[]},{"id":"grand_archive.4100","title":{"zh":"","en":""},"texts":[],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":true,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"grand_archive.4105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","sto